# Upload scope for CLI deployments run from the repository root.
#
# The web project's Root Directory is `Part2_Infrastructure/web`, so the CLI has
# to be run from here — from inside `web/` Vercel appends the root directory a
# second time and looks for `web/Part2_Infrastructure/web`, which does not
# exist. Running it from here without this file uploads the whole repository:
# 1.6 GB of venv, node_modules, `.next` and the DuckDB audit log, to build a
# Next.js app out of one subdirectory.
#
# Written as plain exclusions rather than the exclude-everything-then-re-admit
# shape used in `Part2_Infrastructure/.vercelignore`. That shape is correct
# .gitignore syntax and it does not survive here: `**` matches the build
# artifacts *through* the re-admitted `web/**`, and the upload went out at
# 252 MB with `.next` inside it. Naming what to drop is duller and it works.
#
# Both files are needed — they cover deploys started from two different places.

# ── the two directories that dwarf everything else ───────────────────────────
Part2_Infrastructure/venv
Part2_Infrastructure/.venv
Part2_Infrastructure/web/node_modules
Part2_Infrastructure/web/.next
Part2_Infrastructure/web/out
Part2_Infrastructure/web/.turbo

# ── not needed by either Vercel build ────────────────────────────────────────
# This file applies to git deployments as well as CLI uploads, and BOTH Vercel
# projects (developer-analyst-infra and alphaengine-openbb) build from this one
# repository with different Root Directories. Excluding OpenBB_Service here to
# slim the web project's upload starved the OpenBB project's own git build —
# "No FastAPI entrypoint found", because its entrypoint had been ignored out of
# its build context. Only paths that NO project reads may be listed.
Part1_Data_Handling
Part2_Infrastructure/data
Part2_Infrastructure/tests
Part2_Infrastructure/notebooks
Part2_Infrastructure/templates
Part2_Infrastructure/modules
Part2_Infrastructure/docker
docker-compose.yml
supabase
.github

# ── local state, links and secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────
.vercel
Part2_Infrastructure/web/.vercel
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
Part2_Infrastructure/web/*.tsbuildinfo
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
.git
